From 602d215e185c7ae938af657f80058fef3ea42a07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up ERP requests, add tests/CI, and apply Ignatian theme

Backend
- Cache one LRMS session per user with single-flight login and one retry on
  expiry (optional encrypted Mongo store for cold serverless instances)
- Per-user response cache with X-Cache header and ?refresh=1 bypass
- Add GET /api/v1/home aggregate and daily Examen reflection endpoint
- Create Mongo indexes at startup (ensureIndexes was never called)
- Marks reuse cached profile; smaller Mongo pool; CORS_ORIGINS; campus-friendly rate limits
- Fix pre-existing type error in lrms.client.ts
- Vitest + Supertest suite (46 tests)

Web
- New theme tokens, Newsreader + Hanken Grotesk, IHS monogram, church arch login
- Dashboard uses /home, shows partial data, adds daily reflection card
- Fix CSS layering bug: component rules now in @layer components so lg:hidden works

Mobile: palette, motto, church image on login
Infra: vercel.json (bom1), GitHub Actions CI, docs/PERFORMANCE.md
